  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'sondohiwa kwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'asole Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya, u'lete na vizwalo vyav'o visondo, maguta ga ku'v'ila, nzagamba ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, ng'ondi iv'i'li' na ki'sege cha migate i'zyo zikatumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'li'kuminge iv'ilingano lyose bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. Iv'ilingano lyose likumingaga ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wali'wi'laga iv'ilingano, “I'li' hu' igambo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye li'v'ezyeke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wav'aletaga Aloni na v'aane ha mbele, na ku'v'akusa na minzi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuzwi'kaga Aloni nhanzo na ku'mutunga mukwato mu muki'mbi'li', na wamuzwi'kaga ijoho haki'mo na ki'zibao ha igu'lya yalyo na ku'ki'tunga mu muki'mbi'li' ku' mukwato gwacho gwa wu'lembwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' watu'u'laga kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ha igu'lya yacho. Mugati' na kamufuko kenako watu'u'laga Ulimu na Sumimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mihayo Ulimu na Sumimu yi'li'wigelisya ku'v'a gav'age mawe masondo ago muhozya wagatu'u'lage mu kamufuko. Ku' itungo li'mo v'ahozya v'agatu'mi'lage ku'manya wu'yangu' wamwa Mulungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuzwi'kaga Aloni isimangi'la ku' mutwe, na ku'tu'u'la ndezi ya zahabu, yaani ndezi nsondo, ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele lwa isimangi'la, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wasolaga maguta masondo na ku'li'v'ila Ihema Isondo haki'mo na ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li' mugati' yalyo, nawe wavisondohyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanyanyagi'laga maguta ha igu'lya na ihozezyo kali' mupungati'. Hangi' wali'v'ilaga ihozezyo maguta na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose haki'mo na ikalaye na kikali'lo chalyo, ki'gele avisondohye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wamupu'ngu'li'laga lwandi' lwa maguta genago Aloni ku' mutwe na ku'muv'ila, ki'gele amusondohye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'aletaga v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya ha mbele, wav'azwi'kaga nhanzo, na wav'atungaga mikwato haki'mo na masimangi'la, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wayi'fumyaga ng'ombe nzagamba ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, nav'o Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'atu'u'laga makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wayi'si'nzaga yeni'yo ng'ombe na ku'sola lwandi' lwa magazi gayo, hangi' ku' ku'tu'mi'la lyala lyakwe wav'ilaga magazi ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo ki'gele ali'sosohye ihozezyo. Magazi ago gasigali'laga wagiti'laga ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo wali'sondohyaga ihozezyo ki'gele li'zumi'ziwe ku'v'ezezya wu'swanano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasolaga lu'sasa lose, lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma haki'mo na nfigo zyose iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo na wazizigyaga ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ng'ombe yeni'ki'li', nyama yayo, ndi'li' yayo, haki'mo na wu'se wayo, wavizigyaga ha ibala na nkambi', ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wayi'letaga ng'ondi ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, nawe Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'atu'u'laga makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wayi'si'nzaga ng'ondi yeni'yo na ku'nyanyagi'la magazi gayo ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayi'tambagu'zyaga ng'ondi yeni'yo mamonke mamonke na ku'gazigya haki'mo na mutwe na maguta gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wakusaga wu'la wayo, magu'lu' gayo na vikono vyayo ku' minzi', na ku'yi'zigya yeni'yo ng'ondi ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, i'cho ki'li' na wu'motu wa ku'togezya. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose waletaga ng'ondi yi'ngi', yeni'yo hu' yi'li' ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la, nawe Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'atu'u'laga makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wayi'si'nzaga yeni'yo ng'ondi, na wasolaga lwandi' lwa magazi gayo na ku'gav'ila ku' nsoto ya itwi lya mulyi'la lyamwa Aloni, na ku' li'nkumwa lya mukono gwa mulyi'la na ku' li'nkumwa lya mugu'lu' gwa mulyi'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'aletaga v'ana v'amwa Aloni ha mbele, na ku'v'av'ila magazi ku' nsoto zya matwi gav'o ga mulyi'la, na ku' mankumwa ga makono ga mulyi'la, na ku' mankumwa ga magu'lu' gav'o ga mulyi'la. Hangi' magazi ago gasigali'laga wanyanyagi'laga ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasolaga maguta gayo: muki'la gwayo haki'mo na maguta gago, lu'sasa, lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma, nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo, haki'mo na itango lya ku' mulyi'la.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
