          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ku'fuma ku' ki'sege cha migate i'zyo zikatumba i'cho chav'age ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, wasolaga mugate gu'mo u'go gu'kaseleganiwa maguta, na mugate gu'mo gwa wu'seleganiwe na maguta ga muzeituni, na mugate mulelemazu gu'mo. Wavitu'u'laga vyeni'vi vyose ha igu'lya na maguta ga ndimu, na ha igu'lya na i'lo itango lya mulyi'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wavitu'u'laga i'vi vyose mu makono gamwa Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, na ku'v'av'ezya v'aviwu'sye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wavisolaga ku'fuma mu makono gav'o na ku'vizigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo haki'mo na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'simi'ki'la v'ahozya, ka wu'motu wa ku'togezya, ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasolaga ki'dali i'cho ki'li' ifungu lyakwe ku'fuma ku' i'yo ng'ondi ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la, na ku'ki'wu'sya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wasolaga lwandi' lwa maguta ga ku'v'ila, na lwandi' lwa magazi ku'fuma ku' ihozezyo, na ku'ganyanyagi'la ku'mwa Aloni na vizwalo vyakwe, na ku' v'ana v'akwe na vizwalo vyav'o. I'vi hu' vyene wamusondohyaga Aloni na vizwalo vyakwe, haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe na vizwalo vyav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga Aloni na v'ana v'akwe ati', “Nyama yeni'yo muyi'tekele bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na muyi'lyi'le henanho haki'mo na migate ku'fuma mu ki'sege cha kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'simi'ki'la. Muv'ezye vyeni'vyo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zya ku'v'a lwandi' lwenu'lo Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'alalye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' nyama na migate i'zyo zilasigali'le mulazizigye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize muhafume ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati', mpaka nsiku' zinywe zya ku'simi'kwa aho zilav'e zyagelani'la, ku'nguno itungo linywe lya ku'simi'kwa li'lav'e nsiku' mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'lo lyav'eziv'agwa walelo ndi' lyalagi'li'ziwa na Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'mudima kwikala bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a ku' nsiku' mupungati', na ku'li'doonoka i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zya, ki'gele muleke ku'fwa, ku'nguno lyeni'lo hu' i'lo nalagi'li'ziwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'av'ezyaga ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
